Sources
The project draws on peer-reviewed articles, USGS reports, government employment data, and publicly available GIS datasets, including:

USGS SIR 2023–5091 on groundwater quality in abandoned underground coal mine aquifers
West Virginia GIS Technical Center abandoned mine lands data
Studies of acid mine drainage longevity and watershed recovery
BLS, FRED, Census, and WVU employment data

